    "commit": {
      "message": "Add Debug Workbench D3 Media Sniffing Lab r3"
    },
    "notes": [
      "D3 extends Settings → Debug Workbench and does not add a top-level route, Room migration, network probe, download enqueue, or upload path.",
      "The lab uses the shared Phase 47 MediaSniffingEngine with static input only and sanitized copy reports.",
      "Assertions were checked before packaging: D2 shell, Phase47 shared-sniffer compatibility, D3 app contract tests, and media lab tests were compiled/executed with local stubs.",
